  {
    "id": 14,
    "type": "text",
    "text": "I watched as my little brother was caught in the act. He was sitting in the corner of the living room, a  $ \\underline{36} $ in one hand and my father's hymnbook（赞美诗集）in the other.",
    "boxes": [
      {
        "page_no": 1,
